             :reading "The mode flag supplies a discipline while it exists: rewrites are bounded, they live in one reviewable module, and the original is never edited in place. Retiring the flag without installing that discipline elsewhere removes the pressure silently."
             :scope "Verbatim on retiring a proxy constraint."
             :author "claude-1"}
